after building fresh uboot
disable [ ] Enable a default value for bootcmd

load it in boot partition along with MLO

thats it..uboot version is upgraded.

To apply DT Overlay get a dtbo file and then enter uboot sheet. 
In shell follow commands from uboot/docs/fdt_overlay.rst file

before doing bootm command execute setenv bootargs console=ttyO0,115200n8 root=/dev/mmcblk0p2 rw rootfstype=ext4 rootwait earlyprintk mem=512M
load mmc 0:1 ${loadaddr} uImage

then bootm ${loadaddr} - ${fdtaddr}


Commands List


setenv fdtaddr 0x87f00000
setenv fdtovaddr 0x87fc0000
<!-- setenv loadaddr 0x82000000 -->

setenv bootargs console=ttyO0,115200n8 root=/dev/mmcblk0p2 rw rootwait

mmc rescan

load mmc 0:1 $fdtaddr am335x-boneblack.dtb
load mmc 0:2 $fdtovaddr **Overlayfile-path**

fdt addr $fdtaddr
fdt resize 8192
fdt apply $fdtovaddr

fdt print **/device-name**

load mmc 0:1 $loadaddr uImage

bootm $loadaddr - $fdtaddr